  "implemented": "Mark known adjective intention readings unknown per entry when 으려고 is followed by represented auxiliary 하다/들다. 지-negatives preserve dependency, including explicit adjectival 답다; different auxiliaries and copulas reset it. Known conflicts take precedence. Preserve final rhetorical and source-conflicted expanded-expression hypotheses.",
  "not_inferred": [
